stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> AWAITING_PAYMENT: validated booking transaction commits
    AWAITING_PAYMENT --> EXPIRED: deadline reached and allocation safely released
    AWAITING_PAYMENT --> CONFIRMED: future Phase 9 verified success only
    AWAITING_PAYMENT --> PAYMENT_FAILED: future Phase 9 definitive failure only
    EXPIRED --> [*]
    CONFIRMED --> [*]
    PAYMENT_FAILED --> [*]

    note right of AWAITING_PAYMENT
        Phase 8 implements entry and expiry only.
        No public state-update endpoint exists.
        Payment outcomes are not inferred from timeout.
    end note
